OL,3,GNEWSAChild injured and two taken to
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fand a child has been injured after a
OL,8,Fcrash on the A5.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said it
OL,11,Fwas called to reports of a two-car
OL,12,Fcrash at the Queens Head Junction in
OL,13,FOswestry at 09:15 BST.
OL,15,FA man and a woman were taken to the
OL,16,FRoyal Shrewsbury Hospital and a child
OL,17,Fwas treated at the scene by paramedics
OL,18,Ffor minor injuries, the service added.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
