OL,3,GNEWSAChild injured and two taken to
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Mercia Police, who also attended
OL,7,Fthe scene, said the road had been
OL,8,Fpartially blocked, but had since
OL,9,Freopened and no arrests had been made.
